e blood of the one who shed it. The juxtaposition of the commandment against murder to the promise of prolonged days upon the land suggests that murder would undermine the very longevity the verse promises.", :sources ["Numbers 35:33"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :other, :note "Juxtaposition (semikhut) of the father-honor commandment to the Sabbath commandment", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :other, :note "Tagin on the letter tet in ייטב, signaling the number 9", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :rashei-tevot, :phrase "אסנ\"ת משגע\"ח", :spells "בני אנוסה בני שנואה בני נדה בני תמורה בני מריבה בני שכרות בני גרושת הלב בני ערבוביא בני חצופה", :letters ["א" "מ"], :by :selah, :order :mismatch} {:kind :gematria, :a "י\"ז תיבות יתרות דברות אחרונות על הראשונות", :a-value 4202, :b "טוב", :b-value 17, :lens :standard, :by :selah, :equal? false} {:kind :sofei-tevot, :phrase "כאשר צוך ה' אלהיך", :spells "מרה", :letters ["ר" "ך" "ה" "ך"], :by :selah, :order :mismatch} {:kind :other, :note "Juxtaposition of לא תרצח to the land-promise verse", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:34:51.538273834Z", :model "glm-5.2"}